    "A hash or object key without both referenced payload and receipt bytes proves identity intent, not historical availability.",
    "Git commit time, filesystem mtime, event time and kickoff time must not be synthesized into robin_first_observed_at.",
    "Date-only legacy records cannot establish intraday ordering.",
    "All 157 committed JSON.GZ files pass local compressed/decompressed integrity checks, but integrity is not point-in-time lineage.",
    "Thirty-seven PostgreSQL surfaces are EXTERNAL_UNOBSERVED and were not queried."
